// A minimal Embalm carrier ([CR#702.128a]): "Embalm [cost]" — exile this from
// your graveyard for a token copy that's a white Zombie, sorcery-speed. No card
// in the canon slice carries Embalm (the copy grammar is brand new), so this
// fixture isolates the copy-consuming keyword's expansion + graduation.
Normal(
    name: "Embalm Test Creature",
    mana_cost: [Generic(2), White],
    types: [Creature],
    power: 2,
    toughness: 2,
    abilities: [
        Keyword(Embalm([Mana([Generic(3), White])])),
    ],
)
